@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR-Option-Off,ArmR2,ArmL3,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Uncomfortable_Open02,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Uncomfortable_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:録音した声を聞かせた？<br>データを消した？<br>ミリアを殺した？|#0102Trial10_AnAn001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR-Option-Off,ArmR2,ArmL3,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Closed,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……すべて、<br>わがはいがやった<br>証拠などない。<br>ただの戯言だ。|#0102Trial10_AnAn002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR-Option-Off,ArmR2,ArmL3,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open01,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:そもそもそれらが本当に<br>事件に関連しているかも<br>不明だ。<br>机上の空論だろう。|#0102Trial10_AnAn003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmL5,Angle01/ArmR-,Eyes1_Angry_Open1,Mouth1_Surprised_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……それを言うなら<br>私だってそう。<br>私も佐伯ミリアを<br>殺した証拠なんてないわ。|#0102Trial10_Nanoka001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR-Option-Off,ArmR2,ArmL3,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open01,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:お前には少なくとも<br>部屋に入ったという<br>証拠がある。|#0102Trial10_AnAn004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1,ArmR2,ArmL5
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:ナノカちゃんから<br>提出された<br>懲罰房の鍵ね？|#0102Trial10_Margo001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1,ArmR7,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:でもそれだって<br>ナノカちゃんから<br>提出された物だし、<br>錠前も壊れ<br>ちゃってるから<br>本物か検証は<br>できないけれど……。|#0102Trial10_Margo002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR-Option-Off,ArmR2,ArmL3,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open01,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……なんにせよ、<br>わがはいが犯人だという説に<br>根拠はない。|#0102Trial10_AnAn005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR-Option-Off,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open01,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"鍵が開いてたなら<br><link=\"Objection_01_02_10_01\">誰でも部屋に入れた</link>し、<br><link=\"Objection_01_02_10_02\">殺害もできた</link>。<br><link=\"Objection_01_02_10_03\">声の偽装</link>だって、<br>他の者にもできた<br>のだからな。|#0102Trial10_AnAn006|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:AnAn.Default,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR-Option-Off,ArmR5,ArmL2,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open02,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Uncomfortable_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:AnAn Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:だから<br>これ以上の議論は<br>無駄だ。<br>……わがはいは<br>犯人ではないのだから。|#0102Trial10_AnAn007| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4


